    5. Place n_markers on distinct cells with Manhattan distance >=2 between all pairs and at most 1 per scan-line; verify isolation
    6. Pick 3-4 distinct non-background colors, assign randomly to markers
    7. Verify bbox extents match chosen scan direction; retry placement if not
